graph TD
    S[Start] --> G1[Given: (31n-) men work in (21n+) days]
    G1 --> G2[Given: (31n+) men work in (43n-) days]
    G2 --> R[Given ratio of work: x : y = 6 : 11]
    R --> E1[Work equation 1: (31n-)*(21n+) = x]
    E1 --> E2[Work equation 2: (31n+)*(43n-) = y]
    E2 --> P[Set up proportion x / y = 6 / 11]
    P --> S1[Substitute: (31n-)*(21n+) / (31n+)*(43n-) = 6/11]
    S1 --> Sim[Cancel common terms: (21n+) / (43n-) = 6/11]
    Sim --> Solve[Cross-multiply and solve for n]
    Solve --> Result[Find n = 2]
    Result --> End[End]
    classDef startEnd fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    class S,End startEnd;